it, and a run of small `Nat` literals pushed onto an `Array Nat` becomes a
table (`ArrayLits`; translation plan §5.12). Elements on both sides of the
table's range (2^63 - 1, 2^63, a big number) and literals of other element
types (`UInt64`, `String`, a `List`, a `ByteArray`, a literal read from a
function) keep their values and order. -/
